      "message": "Naming isn\u0027t right for what it\u0027s doing.\n\nA few alternatives options I think are better:\n* `profile_enabled_or`: Either the profile is enabled or you get this default value.\n* `guard_profile_or`: Guard profile or provide this default value.\n* `enabled_or`: Shorter version of the above. This is enabled or you get this value.\n\nThis macro should behave similarly to and be named like `unwrap_or` in my opinion. You may also want a version that\u0027s just `enabled_or_default` which always replaces the `ret_stmt` with `default::Default()`.",
